CONTENTS
This repository contains source definitions (TM1 rule files and TurboIntegrator process sources),
scripts and documentation, intended to build and run the FPABench model on a separately licensed IBM
Planning Analytics / TM1 server. It is experimental and has not been installed, executed or validated on
IBM Planning Analytics TM1 Server v11 or TM1 Database v12. It contains no IBM software or libraries, no
files saved by a TM1 server, no exported TM1 server database and no measured TM1 benchmark results.

